# Clawdbot Security & Workspace Settings

# 1. Credentials and Config (CRITICAL)
# Never push the bot's configuration or secret keys.
.clawdbot/
clawdbot.json
*.token
*.key
*.pem

# 2. Personal Data and Memories (PRIVACY)
# These contain chat history, personal notes, and context.
memory/
MEMORY.md
SOUL.md
USER.md
IDENTITY.md
AGENTS.md
TOOLS.md

# 3. Media and Logs
# Avoid uploading large files or transient data.
.clawdbot/media/
*.log
tmp/
temp/

# 4. Environment Variables
.env
.env.*

# 5. Common OS/IDE files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
